            "review_title": "Review at Vin De Soleil Bistronomy",
            "review_text": "Martine L\nFyresdal, Norway28 contributions\n0\nBad beef and poor service\nApr 2019 • Couples\nThis restaurant is expensive and good looking, but the quality of western food does not meet anyone’s standard. \nThe beef was chewy and poorly prepared as was the fish soup. The duck salad was ok.\n\nThe wine however was really nice, so for a bottle of wine ( it is only served by the bottle) it is nice.\nWritten April 26, 2019",
